swsml (0.6.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging, split by backend:
    - libswsml0 / libswsml-dev      (Rust cdylib C-ABI)
    - libswsml-cpp0 / libswsml-cpp-dev (C++17 RAII wrapper)
  * SONAME libswsml.so.0 and libswsml_cpp.so.0 (single SONAME_MAJOR variable).
  * pkg-config modules: swsml / swsml_cpp (deliberately not "sml", which
    collides with the Debian SML smart-meter ecosystem).
  .
  NOTE: prototype for a future formal debhelper build. It has NOT been built
  or verified on the author's machine; the working, validated path is
  packaging/build_deb.sh (dpkg-deb --build).

